# Filesystem corruption quarantine — a file here has a FUSE-level EIO error on every
# stat/open/unlink (survived from a mid-session external-disk disconnect) and can't be
# deleted by any userspace tool. Ignored so `git add`/`git status` never touch it.
.quarantine/
